6.2.1. perform services not only for the Company but also, as the Company may from time to time reasonably require, for any other Lesaka Group Company and without further remuneration, and to accept such offices in other Lesaka Group Companies; and

6.2.2. travel to such places within or outside South Africa by such means and on such occasions as the Company may from time to time require.

